        "original_id": "4a7809a5-d6bb-57b7-9cf7-4c303a66e648",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luke Goss, David S. Goyer, Guillermo del Toro, Wesley Snipes, Lance Henriksen\n- Films: Blade II, One Night with the King, Hellboy II: The Golden Army, Tekken, Interview with a Hitman, Bone Dry\n- Roles: Jared Nomak, King Xerxes, Prince Nuada, Steve Fox, Viktor, lead character, producer\n\nFacts:\n- In 2002, Luke Goss appeared in Blade II as Jared Nomak.\n- Blade II was written by David S. Goyer, who also wrote the previous film.\n- Blade II was directed by Guillermo del Toro.\n- In Blade II, Wesley Snipes returned as the lead character and producer.\n- In 2006, Luke Goss appeared in One Night with the King as King Xerxes.\n- Bone Dry starred Luke Goss and Lance Henriksen.\n- In 2008, Luke Goss appeared in Hellboy II: The Golden Army as Prince Nuada.\n- In 2010, Luke Goss appeared in Tekken as Steve Fox.\n- In 2012, Luke Goss appeared in Interview with a Hitman as Viktor.",
